post lamp and sustains injuries. Accompanied
by the police, he is brought to the Emergency
Department. According to the police, he has
had multiple occasions of violence, offence,
bar fights, and vandalism, for which he has
been arrested several times during the past
five years. He drinks alcohol, smokes
marijuana, and sometimes uses cocaine.
