concerned about his risk of developing
prostate cancer. The concern arose when his
father was diagnosed with prostate cancer at
the age of 88 years a few months ago. His
worry was worse when he realized that his
neighbour has prostate cancer as well. The
neighbor has told him that there is screening
test for early detection of prostate cancer. He
asks to undergo screening after you fully
explained to him the pros and cons of
screening protocols and the uncertainty. On
digital rectal exam (DRE), prostate is smooth
and of normal size and shape. The medial
Sulcus is felt. Which one of the following is the
